# M4 step 2b: TWAI loopback self-test on board C (0x8160), no transceiver, 2026-10-04.
# Firmware: variant can-loop (CONFIG_POT_RADIO_DISABLE, CONFIG_POT_CAN, CONFIG_POT_CAN_LOOPBACK,
# CONFIG_POT_M4_SAFE_STATE_MS=1000), RX on the TX pin as Espressif's own test does.
# The first attempt, with RX on its own floating pin, logged 17 bit errors and "node is bus off".
